  lines:
  - speaker: Ryan
    text: eh guys, tadi aku keliling didesa.
    pfp: {fileID: 1102108819684225473, guid: 717fe866f10db74429e9a9133c64ab34, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Ryan
    text: 'kata orang desa, aki aki yang kita liat kemarin emang kurang aja, bima
      tuh ketakutan banget.

'
    pfp: {fileID: 1102108819684225473, guid: 717fe866f10db74429e9a9133c64ab34, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Tari
    text: malu ih bim, dah gede juga.
    pfp: {fileID: 1102108819684225473, guid: 717fe866f10db74429e9a9133c64ab34, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Tari
    text: malu ih bim, dah gede juga.
    pfp: {fileID: 1102108819684225473, guid: 717fe866f10db74429e9a9133c64ab34, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Bima
    text: ga ga ga firasat gw tetap ga enak disini, pulang yuk.
    pfp: {fileID: 1102108819684225473, guid: 717fe866f10db74429e9a9133c64ab34, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Ryan
    text: wkwkwk. tapi kayaknya emang ada yang aneh sama desa ini
    pfp: {fileID: 1102108819684225473, guid: 717fe866f10db74429e9a9133c64ab34, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Ryan
    text: Orang-orang desa sini agak aneh gelagatnya
    pfp: {fileID: 1102108819684225473, guid: 717fe866f10db74429e9a9133c64ab34, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Tari
    text: udah padatidur sana
    pfp: {fileID: 1102108819684225473, guid: 717fe866f10db74429e9a9133c64ab34, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Tari
    text: Yaudahlah, udah terlanjur kesini
    pfp: {fileID: 1102108819684225473, guid: 717fe866f10db74429e9a9133c64ab34, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 0}
